
<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="en">
<head>
<meta charset="UTF-8">
<meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0">
<title>For Puggu 💗</title>

<style>
* {
  margin: 0;
  padding: 0;
  box-sizing: border-box;
}

body {
  min-height: 100vh;
  font-family: Georgia, 'Times New Roman', serif;
  background: linear-gradient(135deg, #fff0f5, #ffe0eb, #fff5f7);
  color: #754b5b;
  overflow-x: hidden;
}

#hearts {
  position: fixed;
  inset: 0;
  pointer-events: none;
  overflow: hidden;
  z-index: 0;
}

.heart {
  position: absolute;
  bottom: -30px;
  animation: floatUp linear forwards;
  opacity: .55;
}

@keyframes floatUp {
  to {
    transform: translateY(-110vh) rotate(360deg);
    opacity: 0;
  }
}

main {
  position: relative;
  z-index: 1;
  width: 100%;
  max-width: 650px;
  margin: auto;
  padding: 24px 18px 45px;
}

.stage {
  display: none;
  min-height: 85vh;
  align-items: center;
  justify-content: center;
  flex-direction: column;
  text-align: center;
  animation: appear .8s ease;
}

.stage.active {
  display: flex;
}

@keyframes appear {
  from {
    opacity: 0;
    transform: translateY(20px);
  }
  to {
    opacity: 1;
    transform: translateY(0);
  }
}

.small {
  letter-spacing: 4px;
  text-transform: uppercase;
  font-size: 11px;
  color: #c27d98;
  margin-bottom: 20px;
}

h1 {
  font-size: clamp(38px, 10vw, 65px);
  color: #bd718e;
  margin-bottom: 18px;
  line-height: 1.15;
}

h2 {
  font-size: clamp(27px, 7vw, 39px);
  color: #bd718e;
  margin-bottom: 20px;
}

p {
  font-size: 17px;
  line-height: 1.9;
  margin: 12px 0;
}

.flower {
  font-size: 55px;
  margin: 12px;
  animation: sway 3s infinite ease-in-out;
}

@keyframes sway {
  50% { transform: rotate(10deg) scale(1.08); }
}

button {
  border: none;
  padding: 15px 28px;
  border-radius: 35px;
  background: linear-gradient(135deg, #e99ab5, #cb7597);
  color: white;
  font-size: 15px;
  cursor: pointer;
  box-shadow: 0 7px 20px #d88ba64d;
  margin-top: 24px;
  transition: .3s;
}

button:active {
  transform: scale(.95);
}

button:hover {
  transform: translateY(-3px);
}

.card {
  background: #ffffffb8;
  border: 1px solid #f7d2df;
  border-radius: 23px;
  padding: 24px 20px;
  margin: 10px 0;
  width: 100%;
  box-shadow: 0 8px 25px #d88ba61c;
}

.card h3 {
  color: #bd718e;
  font-size: 21px;
  margin-bottom: 8px;
}

.card p {
  font-size: 15px;
}

.big-heart {
  font-size: 75px;
  margin: 15px;
  animation: beat 1.5s infinite;
}

@keyframes beat {
  50% { transform: scale(1.18); }
}

.envelope {
  width: 210px;
  height: 135px;
  background: #e99ab5;
  border-radius: 8px;
  position: relative;
  margin: 35px auto;
  cursor: pointer;
  box-shadow: 0 10px 30px #c77b9544;
}

.envelope:before {
  content: "";
  position: absolute;
  top: 0;
  left: 0;
  border-left: 105px solid transparent;
  border-right: 105px solid transparent;
  border-top: 80px solid #f5b6ca;
  transform-origin: top;
  transition: .6s;
  z-index: 2;
}

.envelope.open:before {
  transform: rotateX(180deg);
}

.envelope:after {
  content: "💌";
  position: absolute;
  font-size: 45px;
  top: 42px;
  left: 82px;
}

.letter {
  display: none;
  background: #fffafc;
  padding: 25px;
  border-radius: 18px;
  border: 1px solid #f4cada;
  text-align: left;
  line-height: 1.9;
  width: 100%;
  white-space: pre-line;
}

.letter.show {
  display: block;
  animation: appear .8s ease;
}

.signature {
  text-align: right;
  color: #c27d98;
  margin-top: 20px;
  font-style: italic;
}

.footer {
  color: #c28da2;
  font-size: 12px;
  margin-top: 35px;
}

@media(max-width: 400px) {
  p { font-size: 15px; }
  .card { padding: 19px 15px; }
}
</style>
</head>

<body>

<div id="hearts"></div>

<main>

<!-- STAGE 1 -->
<section class="stage active" id="stage1">
  <div class="flower">🌸</div>
  <div class="small">A little something for someone special</div>
  <h1>Hey, Puggu!</h1>
  <p>
    Someone has made a little corner of the internet
    just for you. 💗
  </p>
  <p>Are you ready for a tiny surprise?</p>
  <button onclick="nextStage(2)">OPEN MY GIFT 🎁</button>
</section>

<!-- STAGE 2 -->
<section class="stage" id="stage2">
  <div class="small">A beautiful beginning</div>
  <div class="flower">🦋</div>
  <h2>The Day I Met You</h2>

  <div class="card">
    <p>
      Puggu, sometimes we meet people without knowing
      how important they will become in our lives.
    </p>
    <p>
      And then, slowly, they become a beautiful part
      of our everyday world.
    </p>
    <p>
      That's what happened when I met you.
      My life changed in so many little ways,
      and I'm genuinely grateful that our paths crossed.
    </p>
  </div>

  <button onclick="nextStage(3)">THERE'S MORE 💗</button>
</section>

<!-- STAGE 3 -->
<section class="stage" id="stage3">
  <div class="small">Things I'll always appreciate</div>
  <h2>Things You've Taught Me 🌷</h2>

  <div class="card">
    <h3>🌱 To understand life</h3>
    <p>Your advice has helped me look at situations differently.</p>
  </div>

  <div class="card">
    <h3>🦋 To keep growing</h3>
    <p>You remind me that there's always something new to learn.</p>
  </div>

  <div class="card">
    <h3>💗 To value myself</h3>
    <p>Your words have made me think more positively about life.</p>
  </div>

  <p>
    Maybe you don't realise it, but your little pieces
    of advice mean a lot to me.
  </p>

  <button onclick="nextStage(4)">ONE MORE THING ✨</button>
</section>

<!-- STAGE 4 -->
<section class="stage" id="stage4">
  <div class="small">A few little reasons</div>
  <h2>Why You're Special 💖</h2>

  <div class="card">
    <h3>🌸 Your presence</h3>
    <p>You make ordinary moments feel a little more beautiful.</p>
  </div>

  <div class="card">
    <h3>🥹 Your advice</h3>
    <p>You don't just listen; you help me understand things.</p>
  </div>

  <div class="card">
    <h3>🫶 Your friendship</h3>
    <p>I'm lucky to have someone like you in my life.</p>
  </div>

  <div class="card">
    <h3>✨ Simply YOU</h3>
    <p>You don't need to be anyone else to be special.</p>
  </div>

  <button onclick="nextStage(5)">OPEN YOUR LETTER 💌</button>
</section>

<!-- STAGE 5 -->
<section class="stage" id="stage5">
  <div class="small">Written from the heart</div>
  <h2>A Letter For You 💌</h2>

  <p>There's something I've wanted to tell you...</p>

  <div class="envelope" id="envelope" onclick="openLetter()"></div>

  <p id="tapText">Tap the envelope to open it 🌷</p>

  <div class="letter" id="letter">
    Dear Puggu,

    I honestly don't know how to explain how much
    your friendship means to me.

    When I met you, I never imagined that you
    would become such a beautiful part of my life.

    You've given me advice, helped me understand
    life, and made me see things from different
    perspectives.

    Sometimes even a small conversation with you
    can make my day better.

    I may not say it every time, but I appreciate
    you more than you know.

    Thank you for being YOU.
    Thank you for being in my life.

    And please remember that you are someone
    worth appreciating, always. 💗

    <div class="signature">
      With lots of love &amp; appreciation,<br>
      Your bestie 💗
    </div>
  </div>

  <button id="lastButton" style="display:none"
          onclick="nextStage(6)">
    WAIT... ONE LAST SURPRISE 🥹
  </button>
</section>

<!-- STAGE 6 -->
<section class="stage" id="stage6">
  <div class="small">Just for you</div>
  <div class="big-heart">💗</div>
  <h1>Hey Puggu!</h1>

  <div class="card">
    <h2>One little promise 🌸</h2>
    <p>
      No matter how busy life gets, I hope we never
      forget how beautiful this friendship is.
    </p>
    <p>
      Keep smiling, keep growing, and never stop
      being the wonderful person you are.
    </p>
    <p>
      I'm really glad I met you.
    </p>
    <h2>YOU'RE A BEAUTIFUL PART OF MY LIFE. 🥹</h2>
  </div>

  <p>And if you ever forget how special you are...</p>
  <p>Come back and read this again. 💌</p>

  <div class="flower">🌷🌸🌷</div>

  <button onclick="celebrate()">SEND SOME HAPPINESS 💗</button>

  <p id="finalMessage"></p>
</section>

<div class="footer">
  Made with love, especially for Puggu 🌸
</div>

</main>

<script>

// CHANGE STAGES
function nextStage(number) {
  document.querySelectorAll(".stage").forEach(stage => {
    stage.classList.remove("active");
  });

  document.getElementById("stage" + number).classList.add("active");

  window.scrollTo({top: 0, behavior: "smooth"});
}

// OPEN ENVELOPE
function openLetter() {
  const envelope = document.getElementById("envelope");
  const letter = document.getElementById("letter");
  const button = document.getElementById("lastButton");
  const text = document.getElementById("tapText");

  if (letter.classList.contains("show")) return;

  envelope.classList.add("open");

  setTimeout(() => {
    letter.classList.add("show");
    text.style.display = "none";
    button.style.display = "inline-block";
  }, 500);
}

// FLOATING HEARTS
const hearts = document.getElementById("hearts");

function createHeart() {
  const heart = document.createElement("div");
  heart.className = "heart";
  heart.innerHTML = ["💗", "💕", "🌸", "✨"][Math.floor(Math.random()*4)];

  heart.style.left = Math.random() * 100 + "vw";
  heart.style.fontSize = (12 + Math.random() * 18) + "px";
  heart.style.animationDuration = (5 + Math.random() * 6) + "s";

  hearts.appendChild(heart);

  setTimeout(() => heart.remove(), 11000);
}

setInterval(createHeart, 650);

// FINAL SURPRISE
function celebrate() {
  const message = document.getElementById("finalMessage");

  message.innerHTML =
    "A million little smiles for you, Puggu! 💗🌸✨";

  for(let i = 0; i < 30; i++) {
    setTimeout(createHeart, i * 80);
  }
}

</script>

</body>
</html>
